></div><div id=\"view_game_441824\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable Irondrive for Windows</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"22\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" width=\"22\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><div style=\"text-align: center\"><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4599730/Irondrive/?utm_source=itch&utm_medium=free&utm_campaign=itch\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><img title=\"Irondrive Wishlist on Steam\" alt=\"Irondrive Wishlist on Steam\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3NzA2ODkyLnBuZw==/original/ByM47m.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><span></span></figure></div>\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2>Manage a moving fortress. Keep your crew alive&hellip; or watch everything fall apart</h2>\r\n<p>Irondrive is a top-down vehicular roguelike where crew management meets base building on wheels.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h3>FEATURES</h3>\r\n<ul><li>Build and repair your moving base in real time</li><li>Manage crew needs (hunger, injuries, panic)</li><li>Survive attacks from enemy vehicles</li><li>Dynamic damage: fire, breaches, system failures</li><li>Everything can go wrong... fast</li></ul>\r\n<p>\ud83c\udfae Play the free demo and see how long your crew survives.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>&quot;For the best experience, download the desktop version. The browser version may have audio or performance issues on some browsers.&quot;</strong><br></p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p><em>This project is a labor of love. Your feedback means much more to me than money.&nbsp;Knowing what you think is the best way to support my work&mdash;please consider leaving a comment if you enjoyed it.</em></p>\r\n<p><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_5518907\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"19 August 2026 @ 07:02 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 14 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://alessandrolemura.itch.io\">Alessandro Le Mura</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-strategy\">Strategy</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-simulation\">Simulation</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-survival\">Survival</a></td></tr><tr><td>Made with</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/made-with-godot\">Godot</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-2d\">2D</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-colony-sim\">colony-sim</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-ftl\">ftl</a>, <a href=